# Copy to .dev.vars (gitignored). Read by `wrangler pages dev`.
# Who you are while developing; honoured on localhost only.
DEV_IDENTITY=you@example.com
# Optional: read the real index from the data repository instead of public/index.json.
# GITHUB_TOKEN=github_pat_…
# Required once an Access application exists (its Application Audience tag).
# POLICY_AUD=
